  "prefLabel": "Lab 702.07 Second opinion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 702.07 “Second opinion” means a medical examination conducted by a qualified healthcare provider at the request of an injured employee within a managed care network solely for the purpose of determining or confirming a diagnosis or the proper course or treatment for the injuries.\n\nSource.. #7338, eff 8-2-00; ss by #9217, eff 8-1-08; ss by #12013, eff 10-25-16 (from Lab 702.08)",
